ざいます。リンゴと呼んでください。」\n\n「アカちゃんは室内猫なんです……私の家から出たことなんてないのに」リンゴはため息をついた。\n\n「さっきまでベッドで寝てたはずなのに。どうやって外に出たのか、さっぱり分からない……」", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@skebe45/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1947864856771891201%2F3xzlaAzd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33622c1ad7f03ef9c9e430159cddc3eb", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1947864856771891201%2F3xzlaAzd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33622c1ad7f03ef9c9e430159cddc3eb, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1947864856771891201%2F3xzlaAzd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b7fbd7c9cc09b6c2f41d142942c326d9 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1947864856771891201%2F3xzlaAzd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a3eced4ad7f52a56e719366bc7f9646b 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3750311, "nc": 49}, {"path": "/@skebe45/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1947864856771891201%2F3xzlaAzd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33622c